# Always-plugged-in phone: charge voltage 4.00 V (about 60-65 % state of charge) and charge current 500 mA.
# Only on "add": the charger sends "change" on every cable event, and s10-thermal-guard owns the current after boot.
# The guard also holds the voltage at <= 4.00 V, so losing this rule does not mean charging to 4.35 V.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="power_supply", KERNEL=="max77705-charger", ATTR{constant_charge_voltage}="4000000", ATTR{input_current_limit}="2000000", ATTR{constant_charge_current}="500000"
